Three video simulations have been uploaded to demonstrate the functionality of the Cattle Telemedicine Application for its three primary user roles: Pet Owner, Veterinarian, and Admin.
Each video provides a detailed walkthrough of the respective module, showcasing the key features and workflows available to the user. The Pet Owner simulation demonstrates cattle registration,
consultation booking, and communication with veterinarians. 
The Veterinarian simulation highlights profile management, consultation handling, and interaction with pet owners. 
The Admin simulation illustrates the approval and management of veterinarian accounts, as well as overall system administration. 
These videos provide a comprehensive understanding of the application's operation and user experience.
